  "solution": {
    "text": "\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& 10^n+3\\left(4^{n+2}\\right)+5 \\text { Taking } n=2, \\\\\n& 10^2+3 \\times 4^4+5=100+768+5=873\n\\end{aligned}\\)\nTherefore this is divisible by 9.",
